"},{\"title\":\"Icotek KEL-DP 32|10 B gy: Cable Entry Plate - 43560\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kel-dp-3210-b-gy-cable-entry-plate-43560\"}]\n\nI found information about icotek cable entry plates, but I need to search more specifically for the KEL-DP 10 rectangular model with the details you're looking for.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"KEL-DP\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/Produkte/PDFs/en_IN/KEL-DP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"icotek GmbH & Co. KG - Free CAD models - KEL-DP 10 - TraceParts\",\"url\":\"https://www.traceparts.com/en/product/icotek-gmbh-co-kg-keldp-10?CatalogPath=ICOTEK:PG06_01&Product=90-26052025-957684\"},{\"title\":\"KEL-DPZ multi-membrane cable entry plates with high cable density / IP66 / UL Type 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en/products/cable-entry-plates/kel-dpz\"},{\"title\":\"KEL-DPZ CR Multi-Membrane Cable Entry Plates for Cleanroom Applications / IP66 / UL Type 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en-us/products/cleanroom-cable-entry/kel-dpz-cr\"},{\"title\":\"icotek GmbH & Co. KG - Free CAD models - KEL-DP 6 - TraceParts\",\"url\":\"https://www.traceparts.com/els/icotek/en/product/icotek-gmbh-co-kg-keldp-66-a-gy?Product=90-26052025-057528&PartNumber=43450\"},{\"title\":\"KEL centrally split cable entry frames for cables with connectors / IP54 / UL Type 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en/products/cable-entry-systems/kel\"},{\"title\":\"KEL Centrally Split Multi Cable Transit Frames for Cables with Connectors / IP54 / UL Type 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en-us/products/multi-cable-transit/kel\"},{\"title\":\"KEL-DPZ-CLICK Multi-Membrane Cable Entry Plates, Snap-In Mounting, M25 - M63 / IP65 / IP66 / IP68\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en-us/products/cable-entry-plates/kel-dpz-click\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek KEL-DP 32|10 A gy: Cable Entry Plate - 43532\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kel-dp-3210-a-gy-cable-entry-plate-43532\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the icotek KEL-DP 10 split cable entry plates:\n\n## KEL-DP 10 Specifications\n\nThe KEL-DP 10 has a cut-out size of 65 × 36 mm, and a mounting height of 5 mm. Height is 12 mm.\n\n### Available Variants\n\nOne variant is the KEL-DP 10|8 A gy with manufacturer part number 43466, accommodating a maximum of 8 cables with clamping range from 1 mm to 12.6 mm.\n\nAnother variant is the KEL-DP 10|26 A gy with part number 43470, which accommodates 26 cables with a clamping range from 1 mm to 6.5 mm.\n\nThe KEL-DP 10 series are designed to match exactly the cut-out dimensions of 10-pin standard industrial connectors. These are easy to assemble and cost-saving alternatives to traditional cable glands.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"08fb37bc-73a7-4046-91b6-4b83f9bcddb1","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:54:55.353Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6d4c6ac9-856f-436c-84f6-8209d0aac5f0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
