{"parentUuid":"276abd63-9573-4d90-92c2-de311ee1dc53","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"50d61844-03e1-47e6-9599-4d79a818d07e","agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SQTigemT6MdLaGbdvLwhx1","type":"tool_result","content":"# KEL Frame Specifications\n\nI've reviewed the provided content, but unfortunately, **the detailed specification table you're requesting is not included** in the web page material shared.\n\nThe page confirms that KEL comes in multiple sizes—specifically mentioning \"KEL 16 and KEL 24\" as base frames, plus \"KEL-B\" for 46 × 46 mm measuring instruments. It also notes that cut-out heights are available in either \"36 mm or 46 mm\" depending on cable routing needs.\n\nHowever, the document lacks the comprehensive data table containing:\n- Specific article numbers for each variant\n- Complete outer dimension measurements\n- Maximum grommet/cable sizes\n- Exact mounting thickness specifications\n\nThe page states: \"The split cable entry frames KEL match exactly the cut-out dimensions of 10-, 16- and 24-pin standard industrial connectors,\" but precise numeric specifications for each frame size aren't provided in this excerpt.\n\n**Recommendation:** Check icotek's technical datasheets, product configurator, or contact their service team (+49 (0) 7175 923 80 - 0) for the complete specifications table."}]},"uuid":"cf267125-3289-4da0-8d57-c25926388ae5","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:55:03.238Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"276abd63-9573-4d90-92c2-de311ee1dc53","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
