{"parentUuid":"af9aaeb4-626c-43b5-8b3f-a65453ad9d49","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"50d61844-03e1-47e6-9599-4d79a818d07e","agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012GxZ6yJGE9qGpspgai7AwN","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"icotek \"KEL 16\" split cable entry frame article number 41216 dimensions grommet KT\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"KEL-U\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en/products/cable-entry-systems/kel-u\"},{\"title\":\"KEL\",\"url\":\"https://pim.icotek.com/Produkte/PDFs/en/KEL.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"KEL centrally split cable entry frames for cables with connectors / IP54 / UL Type 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en/products/cable-entry-systems/kel\"},{\"title\":\"KEL-U CR Split Multi Cable Transit Frames for Cleanroom Applications / IP54 / UL Type 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en-us/products/cleanroom-cable-entry/kel-u-cr\"},{\"title\":\"KEL Centrally Split Multi Cable Transit Frames for Cables with Connectors / IP54 / UL Type 12\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en-us/products/multi-cable-transit/kel\"},{\"title\":\"ICOTEK - Product Catalogue 2016\",\"url\":\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/icotek-product-catalogue-2016/56576675\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek KEL 16|2: Cable Entry Frame - 42162\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kel-162-cable-entry-frame-42162\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek KT 16 gy: Cable Grommets, Large - 41216\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kt-16-gy-cable-grommets-large-41216\"},{\"title\":\"icotek KEL-ER 16 Split Cable Entry Frames • Eagle Sensors & Controls - A Division of Excel Automation LLC\",\"url\":\"https://eagle-sensors.com/icotek-kel-er-16-split-cable-entry-frames/\"},{\"title\":\"6 IP54 IP54 IP54 IP54 IP54 IP54 IP54 IP54 \\u0003 \\u0018\\u000f\\u0018\\u0013\\u0003 \\u0003/\\u0014\\u0003 \\u0003%\\u0014\\u0003 1.11 IP66 1.11\",\"url\":\"https://www.ad-techcci.com/Graphics/icotek/Catalogs/icotek-Split-Cable-Entry-Frames-Catalog.pdf\"}]\n\nI found relevant information about the icotek KEL 16 split cable entry system and the KT 16 grommet with article number 41216.\n\nBased on the search results:\n\n**KEL 16 Split Cable Entry Frame:**\nThe classic KEL is a centrally split cable entry system for routing cables with connectors, providing an IP54 / up to UL Type 12 rating. The split cable entry frame KEL 16 matches exactly the cut-out dimensions of 16-pole standard industrial connectors.\n\n**Dimensions:**\nLength: 120 mm, Width: 58 mm, Height: 17 mm, Cut-out length: 86 mm, Cut-out width: 46 mm\n\n**KT 16 Grommet (Article Number 41216):**\nCable grommet with 1 X 16-17mm clamp area, Length: 42 mm, Width: 41 mm, Height: 19 mm\n\nThe KT large model range is designed for cable diameters from 16 to 34 mm. The slit KT grommet matching the cable diameter is placed around the cable and inserted into the cable entry frame.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"11792fb4-d750-4a95-89ba-a0f1bfdf9c23","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:55:09.917Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"af9aaeb4-626c-43b5-8b3f-a65453ad9d49","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
