{"parentUuid":"bb69a133-aee2-4480-9301-c8c0bfa0453b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"50d61844-03e1-47e6-9599-4d79a818d07e","agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tu8YQeTeaUcmrkAREZqJCo","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"icotek QVT split cable gland M40 pre-terminated connector part number dimensions QT grommet\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"icotek 45715 Split Cable Gland, M40x1.5, Accepts 2 QT Grommets, IP54, Inc Locknut, QVT Series\",\"url\":\"https://us.rs-online.com/product/icotek/45715/72429000/\"},{\"title\":\"Split Cable Gland Guide: How to Choose & Install Right\",\"url\":\"https://electronics.alibaba.com/buyingguides/split-cable-gland-guide-for-pre-terminated-cables\"},{\"title\":\"QVT-CLICK Split Cable Gland for Snap-In Mounting, for Cables with Connectors, M16 - M40 / IP54\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/en-us/products/cable-glands/qvt-click\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek QVT-CLICK 40|2: Split Cable Gland, Pluggable - 45734\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-qvt-click-402-split-cable-gland-pluggable-45734\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek KVT 40 bk: Split Cable Glands - 45028\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kvt-40-bk-split-cable-glands-45028\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek QVT 40|2: Split Cable Gland - 45715\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-qvt-402-split-cable-gland-45715\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek QVT 20: Split Cable Gland - 45695\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-qvt-20-split-cable-gland-45695\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek KVT 40 KGM-PB bk: Split Cable Glands - 45029\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kvt-40-kgm-pb-bk-split-cable-glands-45029\"},{\"title\":\"QVT-Click split cable gland now includes metric sizes 16 and 20\",\"url\":\"https://www.wireandcabletips.com/qvt-click-split-cable-gland-now-includes-metric-sizes-16-and-20/\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek QVT Split Cable Glands - IAC & Associates Inc.IAC & Associates Inc.\",\"url\":\"https://www.iacnassociates.com/icotek-qvt-split-cable-glands/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the icotek QVT split cable gland M40:\n\n## Product Information\n\nThe icotek QVT series includes the model 45715, which is an M40x1.5 split cable gland that accepts 2 QT grommets with IP54 rating and includes a locknut.\n\n## How It Works\n\nQVT is a circular split frame for quick and easy installation of pre-terminated cables or complete cable harnesses. The prefabricated cable is placed into the slit grommet which is set into one of the gland halves.\n\n## Dimensions\n\nFor the QVT 40|2 model:\n- Height: 27 mm, Mounting height: 13 mm, Cut-out size round: 40.4 ± 0.3 mm, Thread: 40x1.5, Thread length: 13 mm\n\n## Part Numbers\n\nThe manufacturer part number is 45715, with the alternate part number QVT 40-2 grey.\n\n## Specifications\n\nMaterial is Polycarbonate, color is gray (similar to RAL 7035), flame class is UL94-V0 self-extinguishing, operating temperature is -30 to 100 degrees Celsius, and it has halogen-free and silicone-free properties.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"47d28c08-89c2-434b-9852-f4f644ced991","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:56:12.523Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bb69a133-aee2-4480-9301-c8c0bfa0453b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
