{"parentUuid":"2d60287b-f29f-4bc3-8af8-96b50a03a786","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"50d61844-03e1-47e6-9599-4d79a818d07e","agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BD138DYLRdvGPPw8XgMT7k","type":"tool_result","content":"# Icotek QVT 40|2 Split Cable Gland - Specifications\n\n**Part Number:** 45715\n\n**Thread:** M40 x 1.5 (13 mm thread length)\n\n**Outer Diameter/Cut-out:** 40.4 ± 0.3 mm (round cut-out size)\n\n**Height:** 27 mm\n\n**Mounting Height:** 13 mm\n\n**Number of Grommets:** 2 (fits 2 small QT inserts)\n\n**Suitable QT Grommets:** Small QT cable grommets (must be purchased separately)\n\n**Material & Properties:**\n- Polycarbonate construction\n- Gray color (RAL 7035 similar)\n- IP54 protection class\n- Temperature range: -30 to 100°C\n- Halogen-free and silicone-free\n- UL94-V0 flame class\n\n**Key Feature:** Designed as a \"circular split cable gland for quick and easy installation of preassembled cables\" with compact structure suitable for small devices and instruments.\n\n**Note:** The product page does not specify maximum cable diameter. For the single-grommet QVT 40 variant, the page references a broader \"Icotek QVT Compact Split Cable Gland M16 - M50\" series but provides no distinct model details."}]},"uuid":"f1f1428d-b867-49ff-ba95-a6a2f995055e","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:56:23.447Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2d60287b-f29f-4bc3-8af8-96b50a03a786","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
