ype":"assistant","uuid":"83c07aee-aa89-4901-99d8-dfc3a548065f","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:56:31.638Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"83c07aee-aa89-4901-99d8-dfc3a548065f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"50d61844-03e1-47e6-9599-4d79a818d07e","agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LWaFm7T8vExhAffdUuiLrh","type":"tool_result","content":"QVT | Compact split cable gland for cables with connectors, M16 - M50 / IP54 QVT is a circular split frame for quick and easy installation of pre-terminated cables or complete cable harnesses. But also electric, pneumatic or hydraulic lines without terminals or connectors as well as corrugated conduits can be easily routed and sealed with IP54. Because of its extremely compact design, the QVT range is especially suitable for small machines, devices and instruments. The cable glands are easy to install. The prefabricated cable is placed into the slit grommet which is set into one of the gland halves. Depending on the size of the cable gland, one, two or four separate grommets can be installed. By using multi- hole grommets up to 16 lines can be routed with one cable gland. Polyamide locknuts as well as a sealing ring are included in the shipment. Speciﬁcations IP rating (EN 60529) IP54 Material Polycarbonate Flame class UL94-V0, self-extinguishing Operating temperature -30 C° to 100 C° Properties halogen free, silicone free Mounting options Fasten with locknut Advantages & beneﬁts Product types & sizes QVT 16 gy 45692 Part No. 4251269311468 EAN 10 Package quantity 2 For max. no. of cables 10 mm Max. cable diameter grey (similar RAL 7035) Colour 30,8 mm External diameter 13 mm Mounting height M16 Cut-out size, metric 16,3 mm Cut-out size, round M16 × 1,5 Thread 13 mm Thread length 1 x QT small Suitable for grommets Space-saving shape ■ Routing of cables with and without connectors ■ Warranty on pre-terminated cables remains ■ Retroﬁts, repairs and maintenance can be done much more easily and quickly ■ Suitable for metric cut-outs ■ Hexagonal locknut included in the delivery ■ Greatly increased cable density when using double or quadruple grommets ■ QVT 20 gy 45695 Part No. 4251269311475 EAN 10 Package quantity 2 For max. no. of cables 11 mm Max. cable diameter grey (similar RAL 7035) Colour 30,8 mm External diameter 13 mm Mounting height M20 Cut-out size, metric 20,3 mm Cut-out size, round M20 × 1,5 Thread 13 mm Thread length 1 x QT small Suitable for grommets QVT 25 gy 45702 Part No. 4251269311482 EAN 10 Package quantity 4 For max. no. of cables 15 mm Max. cable diameter grey (similar RAL 7035) Colour 31 mm External diameter 13 mm Mounting height M25 Cut-out size, metric 25,3 mm Cut-out size, round M25 × 1,5 Thread 13 mm Thread length 1 x QT small Suitable for grommets QVT 32 gy 45711 Part No. 4251269311499 EAN 10 Package quantity 4 For max. no. of cables 15 mm Max. cable diameter grey (similar RAL 7035) Colour 39 mm External diameter 13 mm Mounting height M32 Cut-out size, metric 32,3 mm Cut-out size, round M32 × 1,5 Thread 13 mm Thread length 1 x QT small Suitable for grommets QVT 40-2 gy 45715 Part No. 4251269311505 EAN 10 Package quantity 8 For max. no. of cables 15 mm Max. cable diameter grey (similar RAL 7035) Colour 50 mm External diameter 13 mm Mounting height M40 Cut-out size, metric 40,4 mm Cut-out size, round M40 × 1,5 Thread 13 mm Thread length 2 x QT small Suitable for grommets QVT 50|4 gy 45722 Part No. 4251269311512 EAN 10 Package quantity 16 For max. no. of cables 15 mm Max. cable diameter grey (similar RAL 7035) Colour 62 mm External diameter 13 mm Mounting height M50 Cut-out size, metric 50,4 mm Cut-out size, round M50 × 1,5 Thread 13 mm Thread length 4 x QT small Suitable for grommets","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3ff1df62-b56c-4902-ae0c-9e05b11857d2","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:56:33.355Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"83c07aee-aa89-4901-99d8-dfc3a548065f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch