{"parentUuid":"218a8acd-7463-422f-938e-5f433ca8d303","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"50d61844-03e1-47e6-9599-4d79a818d07e","agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EV7YMNvWMnq14NTQejDUQ6","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"icotek \"KT 20\" grommet large clamping range 20-21 mm part number 41220\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"41220 icotek Cable grommet large Clamping range 20.0 mm - 21.0 mm Temperature range -40°C to 90°C 1\",\"url\":\"https://stex24.com/41220-icotek-cable-grommet-large-clamping-range-20.0-mm21.0-mm-temperature-range40c-to-90c-103653\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek 41220 KT 20 Cable Grommet Slotted Elastomer Grey Dia21mm 1 piece\",\"url\":\"https://www.rapidonline.com/icotek-41220-kt-20-cable-grommet-slotted-elastomer-grey-dia21mm-1-piece-12-1140\"},{\"title\":\"KT cable grommets, grey\",\"url\":\"https://pim.icotek.com/Produkte/PDFs/en-gb/KT%20einfach%20gy.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"41220 Icotek Cable Entries, KT Large Series\",\"url\":\"https://www.galco.com/41220-icotek.html\"},{\"title\":\"KT cable grommets, grey\",\"url\":\"https://www.icotek.com/Produkte/PDFs/en-us/KT%20einfach%20gy.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Icotek KT 20 gy: Cable Grommets, Large - 41220\",\"url\":\"https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kt-20-gy-cable-grommets-large-41220\"},{\"title\":\"41220, Large Icotek Cable Entry Grommets (16mm ~ 34mm)\",\"url\":\"https://www.twittlebit.com/41220\"},{\"title\":\"Item # 41220, Icotek KT20 large single hole gray cable entry grommet with 20mm ~ 21mm clamping range On Twittlebit.com\",\"url\":\"http://eshop.twittlebit.com/item/inserts-grommets/large-icotek-grommets-16-34mm/41220\"},{\"title\":\"33 www.icotek.com KTMB 183 Grommets for KEL 183 Product Description Type\",\"url\":\"https://docs.galco.com/techdoc/ictk/acc_31_44-48_acc.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Partcommunity\",\"url\":\"https://icotek.partcommunity.com/3d-cad-models/?info=icotek%2Fcable20grommets%2Fkt20grey%2Fkt20large%2F41220.prj\"}]\n\nI found comprehensive information about the icotek KT 20 grommet with part number 41220. Here are the details:\n\n## Product Overview\n\nThe icotek KT 20 grey 41220 is a cable grommet with a large clamping range of 20.0 mm - 21.0 mm.\n\n## Specifications\n\nThe grommet has dimensions of 41.5 mm length × 42.0 mm width, operates within a temperature range of -40°C to 90°C, and is made of elastomer material.\n\nIt meets fire behavior standards according to UL V0 according to UL94, is halogen-free, self-extinguishing, and silicon-free.\n\n## Technical Details\n\nThe KT 20 cable grommet is designed for securely routing cables with a maximum diameter of 21 mm. Its slotted design allows easy installation and maintenance of cables.\n\nThe KT large model range is designed for cable diameters from 16 to 35 mm, and correctly sizing the grommet to the cable diameter ensures a high degree of protection (up to IP65) and provides strain relief.\n\n**EAN:** 4251269306556\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"622b5d1f-a4eb-46d2-aa7a-2f2507ae57d4","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:56:42.413Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"218a8acd-7463-422f-938e-5f433ca8d303","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
