.html?type=1664268841\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's the information about the Lapp 1600118 H07RN-F 3G2.5 cable:\n\n**Outer Diameter:**\nThe minimum outer diameter is 10.9 mm and the maximum outer diameter is 14.0 mm.\n\n**Cable Specifications:**\n- 3 cores with 2.5 mm² conductor cross-section\n- Rated voltage: 450/750 V\n- Core insulation and outer sheath material: Rubber\n- Flexible, Class 5 fine-wire construction\n- Insulation color: Black\n\n**Mechanical Properties:**\n- Minimum bending radius for fixed installation: 4 x outer diameter (56.0 mm)\n- Minimum bending radius for occasionally flexing: 5 x outer diameter (70.0 mm)\n\nThis is a heavy-duty rubber cable commonly used for industrial and agricultural applications.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e73d9649-f5fd-436b-be7a-ccf2d6df259a","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:59:03.519Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4ec92da2-8ae8-4d1b-86b8-6be28a6c40a1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
