erial available in gray (similar RAL 7035) color, with properties including UV-resistance, higher chemical resistance, and strain relief.\n\nThe specifications for this model include:\n- Length: 21 mm, Width: 21 mm, Height: 19 mm\n- When installing the grommet, the smooth side of the insert faces the middle of the cable entry frame\n- The double grommet allows for greatly increased packing density when using double or quadruple grommets\n\nThe part number for the gray version is **39917**, while a black version (KT 2|8 bk) is also available with part number 39918. The KT small model range is designed for cable diameters from to 17 mm and is used with cable entry systems including KEL, KEL-U, KEL-ER, KEL-FG, KEL-FL, and KVT range.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"9445d22c-0f2c-4699-8e64-2acc635d6545","timestamp":"2026-10-01T13:00:08.162Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1662e6b4-feeb-454e-90b5-9170d73a8df6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
