\"https://www.lapptannehill.com/53111030-lapp-skintop-reg-st-m-strain-relief-cable-gland-25-metric-gray-standard-thread\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the Lapp SKINTOP ST-M cable gland with article number 53111030. However, I should note that there's a discrepancy: the article number 53111030 appears to correspond to the **M 25 x 1.5** version, not M 32 x 1.5 as mentioned in your query.\n\nFor the **SKINTOP ST-M article 53111030 (M 25 x 1.5)**, the clamping range is 8 - 17 mm.\n\nIf you're looking for the M 32 x 1.5 version of the SKINTOP ST-M, the search results show similar products with a clamping range of 9 - 21 mm, but these have different article numbers (such as 53111440).\n\nCould you verify which thread size (M 25 or M 32) you need? This would help ensure you have the correct clamping range specifications.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"832f180a-15df-4ec3-94ae-59aa21219845","timestamp":"2026-10-01T13:07:06.975Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"31646c6d-0e0c-4abf-9886-7e654826bafc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
