{"parentUuid":"f6ce7163-04c4-4810-a860-f535ed29fbf0","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfbb7hhrDpB2Cp9r86AjF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":630,"cache_read_input_tokens":434937,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":630,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfbb7g8qZTiEKEw8nHwFi","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"64024553-cc69-4b00-9a41-e595649da296","timestamp":"2026-10-01T13:23:36.915Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"64024553-cc69-4b00-9a41-e595649da296","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfbb7hhrDpB2Cp9r86AjF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"İki dosya da hazır. Bunları dünya dökümüne (`_dunya_tam`) karşı denetledim: hiçbir parça zeminin altına inmiyor ve dünyayla çakışma yok. Tek açık sorun diğer ajanın şu anki zemin üstü kanalıyla: o kanal, (b) girişinin çerçevesine ve bazı kablo uçlarına giriyor. Ayrıntısı aşağıda, açık konuların ilk maddesinde.\n\n## 1) `h3/h3_ray_ek_v2.py` (yeni dosya, v1'in sözleşmesi aynen korundu)\n- **Kalkan 8 parça (`ZEMIN_KANALI`, y −60…0):** `kanal_tabani`, `kanal_yan_sol/sag`, `kanal_uc_hat/qr`, `kanal_ayirici`, `kanal_kapagi_koridor/QR_alti`. Oluk tabanındaki eski 30 × 36 kanal ağzı da kapandı.\n- **Robot kablosunun yeni yolu:**\n  - Kablo oluk içinde x 4988'e kadar düz gider, sonra R 100 yayla (5 × d) dönüp oluğun koridor yanından çıkar.\n  - Bu yan duvarda `oluk_yan_koridor` x 5046–5096, y 2–40 ağzı açıldı; üstte 17 mm dudak kalıyor, duvar tek parça.\n  - Yayın son 40°'sinde kablo y 12'den 50'ye yükselir ve tekmelikten x 5088, y 50'de dik geçer.\n  - QR içinde kontrol kutusu (x ≤ 5070) ile kangal arasından inip kangalın alt ucuna (5117,5 · 30 · 825) teğet girer.\n- **Yeni birim `ROBOT_KABLO_KOPRUSU` (6 parça):** zemin üstünde, x 5044–5152, y 0–82, z 575–670, 304 sac 2 mm. Parçalar: `kopru_tabani`, `kopru_yan_sol/sag`, `kopru_arka_ust/sag`, `kopru_kapagi`. Kapağın üstü y 82, servis kapağının altı y 84. (a) girişinin çerçevesi bu kanalın içinde kalıyor.\n- **Kablo hesabı:** uzatma kablosu 2179 → 1713 mm kısaldı. Kangal 10,96 → 11,54 sarım (8,61 → 9,07 m), kangal üstü y 239 → 251; fan altı 275, sığıyor. Standart kablo 4000 ve uzatma 11000 mm tutuyor.\n- (a) girişinin sabitleri tek kaynaktan, `h3_elk_qr_v1.GIRIS_A` ve `TEKME`'den okunuyor.\n- **Öz denetim:** `python ob_calistir.py h3/h3_ray_ek_v2.py` → 30 madde, 0 KALDI. Kendi arasında çakışma yok, QR'ye karşı da yok (düşürülen iki QR parçası hariç). v1'e göre 5 parça değişti, 13 parça aynı kaldı.\n\n## 2) `h3/h3_elk_qr_v1.py`\n**DUSUR'a eklenenler:** `servis_kapagi_alt`, `servis_mentesesi_0`.\n\n**Kaldırılanlar:** `qr_alt_taban_kanali` (+ kapağı), `qr_guc_taban_rakoru_M40` ve `taban_plakasi_3` için açılan M40 deliği.\n\n**Eklenen parçalar (bbox):**\n\n| Parça | Konum (mm) | Not |\n|---|---|---|\n| `qr_tekmelik_plint` | x 4571,5–5428,5 · y 20–81 · z 670–691,5 | 304 1,5, 2 yan kulak; (a) 65×36 ve (b) 86×36 kesikli |\n| `servis_kapagi_alt_kisa` | y 84–446 | yarık ızgara y 94–164'e taşındı (alan aynı), BOM 2 kapak |\n| `servis_mentesesi_0_y100` | y 100–140 | BOM 4 menteşe |\n| (a) KEL 10\\|3 çerçevesi + KT 20 + 2 × BTK | x 5049,5–5147,5 · y 21–79 · z 653–670 | çerçeve dışta, köprü kanalının içinde |\n| `giris_b_KEL-DPZ_16_14` | x 5308–5428 · y 21–79 · z 656–670 | dışta |\n| 8 kablo ucu `qrk_*_giris_b_ucu` | z 695 → 640 | |\n| `qr_omurga_kanali` (+ kapak) | x 5007–5427 · y 20–81,5 | alt dikey kanal dibi → kangal arkası → sağ köşe → giriş (b) toplama kutusu |\n| `qr_taban_gecis_kapama_saci` | x 4755–4840 · z 950–1000 | eski Ø40 ve Ø30 taban deliklerini üstten kapatır |\n| (c) bina beslemesi rakoru + ucu | sağ yan sac | aşağıda |\n\n`qr_alt_dikey_kanal`'ın sağ duvarı dipte açıldı.\n\n**Bina beslemesi 5G6 neden ayrı girişte:** Bu kablo eskiden M40'tan geçiyordu ama KEL-DPZ'nin en büyük membranına (16,2 mm) sığmıyor. Tekmeliğin önünde de yer yok, çünkü kangalın önünde ~18 mm boşluk kalıyor. Bu yüzden sağ yan sacda, ön köşenin 55 mm gerisinde ayrı bir rakorla giriyor.\n\n**Eklenen DELIKLER:** `(\"QR\", \"yan_sac_sag\", Ø32,5 silindir, merkez y 50 · z 725)`. Tekmelik, çerçeveler ve oluk ağzı kendi parçalarım; delikleri doğrudan kestim.\n\n**Katalog numaraları:**\n- **Robot girişi (a):** icotek KEL 10|3 V2A **42212.200** · KT 20 gy **41220** (Ø20–21) · BTK kör lastik gy **41251** × 2\n- **Makine omurgası (b):** icotek KEL-DPZ 16|14 gy **43816**\n  - 4 × 9–16,2 membran: H07RN-F 3G2,5 Lapp **1600118** (Ø10,9–14)\n  - 5 × 5–10,2 membran: 4 adet ETHERLINE Cat.6A **2170465** (Ø8,7) + 1 yedek\n  - 5 × 3,2–6,5 membran: yedek\n- **Bina beslemesi (c):** Lapp SKINTOP ST-M 32×1,5 **53111040** · H07RN-F 5G6 **16001313** (Ø17,5–22,2)\n- ÖLFLEX CLASSIC 110 3G1,5 (1119303) yalnız QR içinde kalıyor (UPS hattı), bu girişlerde kullanılmadı.\n\n## Giriş (b) arayüz noktası (`EQ.arayuz()` bunu veriyor)\n- **Kablo uçları z 640'ta**, yani tekmelik dış yüzünün 30 mm dışında. İstenen z 650 değil, çünkü çerçeve z 656'ya kadar çıkıyor.\n  - Güç kabloları (Ø12): x 5386 / 5402 × y 41 / 59\n  - Cat6A (Ø8,7): x 5354 / 5370 × y 41 / 59\n  - Demet zarfı x 5349,7–5408, y 35–65; merkezi ≈ (5379, 50, 640). İstenen (5395, 45) ile tam örtüşmüyor; 120 mm'lik çerçeve sağ yan sac (5428,5) sınırına dayalı.\n- **Çerçeve zarfı:** x 5308–5428, y 21–79, z 656–670.\n- **(c) 5G6 ucu:** (5460, 50, 725), Ø19,9; rakor gövdesi x 5430–5442.\n\n## Denetim sonuçları (`scratchpad/qrzem/denetim_qr_giris.py`)\n- **Zemin altı:** 325 yeni/değişen parçanın hiçbirinde y < 0 hacmi yok (gerçek kesişimle ölçüldü).\n- **Yeni ve değişen 48 parça ↔ dünya (3923 parça):** > 0,3 mm³ çakışma **0**. Eski RE parçaları, eski QR elektrik parçaları ve düşenler hariç tutuldu; yan saca yeni delik açılmış haliyle bakıldı.\n- **QR elektrik ↔ ray ekleri v2:** 0. **QR elektriği kendi arasında:** 0.\n- **Havada kontrolü (tolerans 0,5):** yeni parçaların hiçbiri havada değil.\n\n## Açık konular\n1. **Diğer ajanın kanalıyla çakışma (bilgi amaçlı, onun dosyasını salt okudum).** `h3_elk_hat_v1` içindeki `zemin_ustu_kanal` (x 5365–5425, üstü 51,5, ucu z 667) ve iki rampası, KEL-DPZ çerçevesine 920–2980 mm³ ve alt sıra kablo uçlarına ~170 mm³ giriyor. Hiçbir KEL çerçevesi y 20–81 bandında 51,5 yüksekliğe inemiyor. Kanalın QR ucu z ≤ 655'te bitmeli ve köprü kanalı gibi ~82 yüksek, x ≈ 5305–5430 genişlikte bir başlıkla çerçeveyi sarmalı.\n2. **5G6 güzergâhı:** sağ yan dış uçtan bina tesisatına nasıl gideceğine Kemal karar vermeli.\n3. **Montaja bağlarken yapılacaklar (benim dosyalarım dışında):**\n   - `hat3_montaj_v4` hâlâ `h3_ray_ek_v1`'i import ediyor; v2'ye çevrilmeli.\n   - `h3/_elk` önbelleği yeniden üretilmeli (`h3_elektrik_v1`'i talimat gereği çalıştırmadım).\n   - `h3_elektrik_v1.BIRIMLER` içindeki `ELK_ZEMIN_KANALI`'nın parçası kalmazsa montajdaki `_dis_birim` assert'i düşer; o birim kaldırılmalı.\n   - Eski `h3/_dunya` dökümüne karşı `denetim()` koşulursa, kapama sacı v1'deki eski robot kablosuyla çakışma gösterir. Döküm v2 ile yeniden alınınca bu kalkar.\n4. **Spesten küçük sapmalar:** tekmelik y 20–81 ve x 4571,5–5428,5 yapıldı (istenen 21–81 ve 4572–5428). Böylece taban plakasına oturuyor ve yan saclara değiyor. KEL-DPZ membran yerleşimi VARSAYIM. KT 20 seçimi Fairino kablo çapı ölçülünce kesinleşecek. SKINTOP ST-M 32'nin sıkma aralığı föyden teyit edilmeli.\n\nOrijinal `h3_elk_qr_v1` yedeği: `scratchpad/qrzem/h3_elk_qr_v1.ORIJINAL.py`.\n\nKaynaklar:\n- [icotek KEL bölünmüş çerçeve föyü](https://pim.icotek.com/Produkte/PDFs/en/KEL.pdf)\n- [icotek KEL-DPZ](https://www.icotek.com/en/products/cable-entry-plates/kel-dpz)\n- [icotek KT 20 41220](https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-kt-20-gy-cable-grommets-large-41220)\n- [icotek BTK 41251](https://trimantec.com/products/icotek-btk-blind-grommet-gy-cable-grommets-small-41251)\n- [icotek QVT (maks. Ø15, robot kablosuna uygun değil)](https://www.icotek.com/en-us/products/cable-glands/qvt-click)\n- [Lapp H07RN-F 3G2,5 1600118](https://e.lapp.com/in/p/cables-for-harsh-conditions/h07rn-f-3g2-5-1600118)\n- [Lapp H07RN-F 5G6 16001313](https://e.lapp.com/in/p/cables-for-harsh-conditions/h07rn-f-5g6-16001313)\n- [Lapp SKINTOP ST-M 32 53111040](https://e.lapp.com/in/p/plastic-cable-glands/skintop-st-m-32x1-5-ral-7001-sgy-53111040)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":630,"cache_read_input_tokens":434937,"output_tokens":7403,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2824},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":630},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":7403,"cache_read_input_tokens":434937,"cache_creation_input_tokens":630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":630,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfbb7g8qZTiEKEw8nHwFi","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"77689476-72c5-45a4-96a2-9494a25f7331","timestamp":"2026-10-01T13:24:07.262Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"f6ce7163-04c4-4810-a860-f535ed29fbf0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"f71387d9-cdc7-4291-91ab-88ffc5025d1e","agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"The coordinator sent a message while you were working:\nOwner wants speed. Please wrap up within ~10 minutes: finish h3_ray_ek_v2.py + the QR kick plate/entries in h3_elk_qr_v1.py with what you have, run only one quick check (no part y<0 + solid intersection of your new/changed parts vs the world dump), then return your report immediately (include the trunk interface point and any DELIKLER/DUSUR you added). I will run the full EL + montaj + checks afterwards.\n\nAddress this before completing your current task."},"isMeta":true,"uuid":"bb6cb2d5-627a-47a4-a881-91f4b7f8ffa2","timestamp":"2026-10-01T13:24:07.304Z","origin":{"kind":"coordinator"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"bb6cb2d5-627a-47a4-a881-91f4b7f8ffa2","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfbbCecTTyX6KKPzqXjC8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":435478,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":272,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfbbCdx2TPgykecYYUhc3","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"2e8914c4-a435-4ac5-87ec-819fa76c8f72","timestamp":"2026-10-01T13:24:16.504Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
{"parentUuid":"2e8914c4-a435-4ac5-87ec-819fa76c8f72","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a07e08770c1a3b00c","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfbbCecTTyX6KKPzqXjC8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both files are done and the checks you asked for are clean. No part goes below the floor, and none of my new or changed parts intersects anything in the full world dump. One thing will need your call: entry (b) clashes with the other agent's current floor duct (section 5).\n\n## 1. `h3/h3_ray_ek_v2.py` (new file, same contract as v1)\n- **Removed:** all 8 old floor-channel parts. These are `kanal_tabani`, `kanal_yan_sol`, `kanal_yan_sag`, `kanal_uc_hat`, `kanal_uc_qr`, `kanal_ayirici`, `kanal_kapagi_koridor` and `kanal_kapagi_QR_alti`. The `ZEMIN_KANALI` unit is gone too.\n- **New unit `ROBOT_KABLO_KOPRUSU`** (the bridge duct): 6 parts in 304 2 mm (`kopru_tabani`, `kopru_yan_sol`, `kopru_yan_sag`, `kopru_arka_ust`, `kopru_arka_sag`, `kopru_kapagi`).\n  - It sits on the floor at x 5044–5152, y 0–82, z 575–670.\n  - Its cover top is at y 82, just under the shortened door, which starts at y 84.\n- **Trough changes:** the old floor-channel hole in `oluk_tabani` is closed. `oluk_yan_koridor` gets an exit opening at x 5046–5096, y 2–40; a 17 mm lip stays on top so the wall is still one piece.\n- **Robot cable route (uzatma_A):**\n  - It runs straight along the trough to x 4988, then turns toward the QR on a 100 mm bend (5 × cable diameter). In the last 40° of the bend it rises from y 12 to y 50.\n  - It crosses the bridge duct and goes straight through entry (a) at x 5088, y 50.\n  - Inside the QR it passes between the robot control box (x ≤ 5070) and the coil, and joins the coil's bottom end at (5117.5, 30, 825).\n- **Cable lengths:** standard 4000 + extension 11000 = 15 m. The cable now needs 5933 mm instead of 6390, so the coil goes from 10.96 to 11.55 turns and its top rises to y 250.9. That stays below the fan (275).\n- **Self-check (both quick and full mode):** 30 checks, 0 failed. This covers no y < 0, no self-intersection, no clash with the QR cabinet (excluding the two dropped parts), and the part-by-part comparison with v1. 24 parts: 8 removed, 6 added, 5 changed, 13 identical.\n\n## 2. `h3/h3_elk_qr_v1.py` (edited)\n**DUSUR added:** `(\"QR\",\"servis_kapagi_alt\")` and `(\"QR\",\"servis_mentesesi_0\")`.\n\n**Removed from this file:** `qr_alt_taban_kanali` and its cover, `qr_guc_taban_rakoru_M40`, and the M40 hole in `taban_plakasi_3`.\n\n**DELIKLER:** removed `(\"QR\",\"taban_plakasi_3\", M40)`. Added `(\"QR\",\"yan_sac_sag\", M32 hole at x 5430, y 50, z 725)` for entry (c).\n\n**New parts:**\n\n| Part | What it is | Location (x / y / z) |\n|---|---|---|\n| `qr_tekmelik_plint` | 304 1.5 kick plate with two 20 mm side flanges, sits on the base plate | 4571.5–5428.5 / 20–81 / 670–671.5 |\n| `servis_kapagi_alt_kisa` | Shortened lower door (transparent material), vent slots moved up to y 94–164, same area | — / 84–446 / — |\n| `servis_mentesesi_0_y100` | Lower door hinge, moved up | — / 100–140 / — |\n| `giris_a_KEL_10_3_cerceve` + `giris_a_KT_20_robot_kablosu` + `giris_a_BTK_kor_0/1` | Entry (a) frame and grommets, outside the plate | 5049.5–5147.5 / 21–79 / 653–670 |\n| `giris_b_KEL-DPZ_16_14` | Entry (b) frame, outside the plate | 5308–5428 / 21–79 / 656–670 |\n| 8 × `qrk_*_giris_b_ucu` | Trunk cable ends for entry (b) | see section 3 |\n| `giris_c_bina_besleme_rakoru_M32` + `qrk_bina_besleme_5G6_giris_c_ucu` | Entry (c): building supply gland and cable end | end at 5460 / 50 / 725 |\n| `qr_omurga_kanali` + cover | Internal trunk duct, 304, 60 tall, sits on the base plate | 5007–5427 / 20–81.5 / 671.5–1048 |\n| `qr_taban_gecis_kapama_saci` | Cover plate over the old Ø40 + Ø30 base-plate holes | 4755–4840 / 20–21.5 / 950–1000 |\n\n- **Internal trunk route:** the bottom of `qr_alt_dikey_kanal` now has an opening in its right wall. From there the duct runs along the back of the coil (z 1012–1048), then forward through the right corner between the coil and the side sheet (x 5379–5427). It ends in a collection box behind entry (b).\n\n**Catalog parts:**\n- **Entry (a):** icotek KEL 10|3 V2A **42212.200** (98 × 58 × 17, cut-out 65 × 36), with KT 20 gy **41220** for the Ø20–21 cable and 2 × BTK gy **41251** blanks. The robot cable's Ø26 connector passes through the 36 mm cut-out.\n- **Entry (b):** icotek KEL-DPZ 16|14 gy **43816** (120 × 58 × 14). It has 4 membranes for 9–16.2 mm, 5 for 5–10.2 mm and 5 for 3.2–6.5 mm.\n  - It carries 4 × H07RN-F 3G2,5 power cables (Lapp 1600118, Ø10.9–14) and 4 × Cat6A data cables (Lapp ETHERLINE 2170465, Ø8.7).\n  - The membrane layout is my assumption.\n- **Entry (c):** Lapp SKINTOP ST-M 32×1,5 **53111040**, for the H07RN-F 5G6 building supply (Lapp **16001313**, Ø17.5–22.2).\n  - The building supply had come up through the old M40 floor gland and doesn't fit any membrane of the entry (b) frame, so it gets its own entry.\n  - I put it in the right side sheet, 55 mm behind the front corner. Inside the QR this is the only free space next to the coil.\n- **Not used:** ÖLFLEX CLASSIC 110 3G1,5 (1119303) is not needed in this trunk.\n\n## 3. Trunk interface point, entry (b)\n- **Cable ends:** all 8 stop at z 640, which is 30 mm outside the kick plate's outer face (z 670).\n  - Power: x 5386 / 5402 at y 41 and 59, Ø12.\n  - Data (Cat6A): x 5354 / 5370 at y 41 and 59, Ø8.7.\n  - The bundle spans x 5349.6–5408, y 35–65, centred about (5379, 50, 640). That is roughly 16 mm off your (5395, 45, 650).\n- **Frame envelope in front of the plate:** x 5308–5428, y 21–79, z 656–670.\n- **Building supply end:** (5460, 50, 725), Ø19.9, outside the right side sheet.\n- `EQ.arayuz()` returns all of these values.\n\n## 4. Check results\n- **No part below the floor:** all 325 new parts (301 QR-layer + 24 robot-rail parts) have no volume at y < 0, checked by real solid intersection.\n- **Against the full world dump** (4234 parts, compared with 3923 after excluding the old robot-rail parts, the old QR layer and the two dropped parts, with the new side-sheet hole cut): **0 intersections above 0.3 mm³.**\n- **New QR layer against new robot-rail parts:** 0. **QR layer against itself:** 0.\n- **Floating check** (tolerance 0.5): every new part touches a supported part.\n\nScripts are in `scratchpad\\qrzem\\` (`denetim_qr_giris.py`, `havada_qr_giris.py`); the original file is kept as `h3_elk_qr_v1.ORIJINAL.py`.\n\n## 5. Open issues\n- **Clash with the other agent's duct.** I built their current `h3_elk_hat_v1` read-only and checked it against my parts. Their `zemin_ustu_kanal` (x 5365–5425, y 0–51.5, ends at z 667) and its ramps (x 5335–5365 and 5425–5455) intersect the entry (b) frame by about 3000 mm³ each. They also hit 4 of the cable ends.\n  - Their duct needs an end hood up to about y 82 that ends at z ≤ 655 or wraps the frame and is about x 5305–5430 wide, like my robot bridge duct.\n  - Otherwise the cable ends sit at y 35–65, above their cover at 51.5.\n  - The building supply end at (5460, 50, 725) also needs a route; where it comes from in the building is still open.\n- **Montaj and other files** (not my scope):\n  - The montaj must import `h3_ray_ek_v2` instead of `v1`.\n  - `h3_elektrik_v1.BIRIMLER` still lists `ELK_ZEMIN_KANALI`. If no `zemin_kanali_*` parts remain, the montaj's `_dis_birim` will stop on \"biriminin parcasi yok\".\n  - Until the montaj re-dumps the world, `h3_elektrik_v1.denetim()` against the old `h3/_dunya` (which still has the v1 robot cable) will report the base-hole cover plate hitting the old cable.\n  - `h3/_elk` needs rebuilding with `h3_elektrik_v1.kur()`.\n- **Assumptions:** the kick plate runs from y 20 rather than 21 so it sits on the base plate. The entry (b) membrane layout and the robot cable's Ø20 are assumptions."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"c